{"id":"enquanto","lemma":"enquanto","pos":"conj","rank":220,"glosses":["as; while (at the same time as)","while; whereas (introduces a situation that is contrasts with another situation)"],"ipa":"/ẽˈkwɐ̃.tu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-enquanto.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-enquanto.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Estou seguro por enquanto.","en":"I'm safe for now.","words":[{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"safe"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Por enquanto, é isso.","en":"That's it for now.","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Enquanto isso, você deveria dormir um pouco.","en":"Meanwhile, you should get a little sleep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1182709","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"should","l":"dever"},{"g":"to sleep"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"slightly"]]},{"text":"Fique no carro por enquanto.","en":"Stay in the car for now.","words":[{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"cart"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Esperei enquanto foi possível.","en":"I've waited as long as possible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845197","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"esperar"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"possible"}]}]}